The complete system combines Restrictions 1 through 15 into a single optimization statement:





$$
\min_{\mathbf{x}, \mathbf{T}, \mathbf{u}, \mathbf{y}, \mathbf{SoC}, \boldsymbol{\Delta}, \mathbf{dim}} \mathcal{F}_{\text{cost}} = \sum_{k \in \mathcal{K}} \sum_{(i,j) \in \mathcal{A}} c_{ij}^k x_{ij}^k + \alpha \max_{k, i}(T_i^k) + \beta \sum_{k, c} \Delta_c^k + \gamma \sum_{o, i, k}(1 - y_{io}^k)^2 + \lambda \sum_{c \in \mathcal{V}_D} Q_c^{\text{buffer}}
$$







$$
\text{Subject to:}
$$







$$
\begin{cases} \text{Restrictions } 1 - 2: & \text{Topology Flow, Subtour Elimination, Makespan \& Shift Durations} \\ \text{Restriction } 3: & \text{Asymmetric Open Time Windows (Pick } b_i = \infty, \text{ Drop } a_c = -\infty \text{ with penalty } \Delta_c^k) \\ \text{Restriction } 4: & \text{Multi-Dimensional Payload Capacity Vector } \mathbf{u}_i^k \le \mathbf{Q}_k \text{ and Split Picking} \\ \text{Restrictions } 5 - 6: & \text{Anti-Collision Clearance, Kinematic Following, SoC Dynamics \& Dock Berths} \\ \text{Restrictions } 7 - 8: & \text{Zone Congestion, Equipment Compatibilities, Multi-Line Order Synchronicity} \\ \text{Restriction } 9: & \text{Multi-Depot Fixed/Floating Return, Fleet Rebalancing \& Inter-Depot Invariance} \\ \text{Restriction } 10: & \text{3D Geometric Packing, LIFO Extraction \& Static Load Compression Stability} \\ \text{Restriction } 11: & \text{Shared HRI Zones, ISO 3691-4 Velocity Throttling \& Manual Aisle Exclusion} \\ \text{Restriction } 12: & \text{Two-Echelon AS/RS Crane Carriage Induction Synchronicity \& Spur Capacities} \\ \text{Restriction } 13: & \text{Consolidation Queue Fluid Balance } \frac{dQ_c}{dt} \le Q_c^{\text{max}} \text{ and Workload Leveling} \\ \text{Restriction } 14: & \text{Spatial Swept-Envelope Enclosures } R_k^{\text{sweep}}(\theta) \text{ and Turnaround Clearance} \\ \text{Restriction } 15: & \text{Chance-Constrained SLA Satisfaction } \mathbb{P}(T_c^k \le L_c) \ge 1 - \epsilon \text{ Under Stockout Risk} \end{cases}
$$
